Package: uncertR
Type: Package
Title: Bootstrap Prediction Uncertainty and Its Biological Drivers in Transcriptomic Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Tanay", "Belapurkar", email = "btanay041@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits bootstrap ensembles of penalized regression models on bulk
    transcriptomic data, derives per-sample uncertainty scores from
    out-of-bag predictions, and tests whether technical covariates explain that uncertainty.
